{"chars": "At the foot of the biggest cedar of all, near the edge of the melting snow, lay a little cluster of leaves pressed flat against the moss in a rosette, like the petals of a green rose. Each leaf was dark green, glossy and cool, no longer than Mrs. Claus's thumb. Down the middle of every leaf ran a bright white stripe. And on these particular plants, the white didn't stop there: a web of fine silver-white veins spread out from the stripe across the whole leaf, crossing and branching like the scales on a snake's back, or the lines between the pieces of a stained-glass window.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.487, 0.487, 0.487, 0.487, 0.487, 0.688, 0.688, 0.688, 0.762, 0.762, 0.762, 0.762, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 1.262, 1.262, 1.262, 1.262, 1.262, 1.262, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.725, 1.725, 1.725, 1.725, 2.175, 2.275, 2.275, 2.275, 2.275, 2.275, 2.462, 2.462, 2.462, 2.462, 2.612, 2.612, 2.612, 2.612, 2.612, 2.888, 2.888, 2.888, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 3.05, 3.05, 3.05, 3.05, 3.05, 3.05, 3.05, 3.05, 3.487, 3.487, 3.487, 3.487, 3.487, 4.15, 4.275, 4.275, 4.275, 4.275, 4.487, 4.487, 4.537, 4.537, 4.537, 4.537, 4.537, 4.537, 4.537, 4.825, 4.825, 4.825, 4.825, 4.825, 4.825, 4.825, 4.825, 5.2, 5.2, 5.2, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.763, 6.763, 6.763, 6.763, 6.875, 6.875, 6.875, 6.875, 6.875, 7.263, 7.263, 7.263, 7.388, 7.388, 7.45, 7.45, 7.45, 7.45, 7.45, 7.45, 7.45, 7.45, 8.275, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.713, 8.713, 8.713, 8.713, 8.713, 8.713, 8.713, 9.175, 9.175, 9.175, 9.287, 9.287, 9.387, 9.387, 9.387, 9.387, 9.387, 9.387, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 10.725, 10.863, 10.863, 10.863, 10.863, 10.863, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.475, 11.475, 11.475, 11.475, 11.688, 11.688, 11.688, 11.688, 11.688, 12.088, 12.088, 12.088, 12.088